    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This Town needs a brave new Hero!</strong></h2>The peace of this city rests in your hands. Keep the gangsters in check and ensure they don't instill fear in the residents.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626840/extras/ad840b110b7f8bd8ff6cc70d2e8bd52c.poster.avif?t=1739799782\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626840/extras/ad840b110b7f8bd8ff6cc70d2e8bd52c.webm?t=1739799782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626840/extras/ad840b110b7f8bd8ff6cc70d2e8bd52c.mp4?t=1739799782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are a born fighter</strong></h2> Dive into battles fearlessly and overcome everyone in your path. No one and nothing can stand in your way. Keep striking, and victory will be yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626840/extras/f3e53e066c5774f18970f0fe4b912ca3.poster.avif?t=1739799782\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626840/extras/f3e53e066c5774f18970f0fe4b912ca3.webm?t=1739799782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626840/extras/f3e53e066c5774f18970f0fe4b912ca3.mp4?t=1739799782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-stop action 24/7</strong></h2> There's no time to rest. Dive into the den of bandits and restore order. No gangster should feel safe. Strike with your hands and feet. Leap onto your enemies and toss them aside. The choice is yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626840/extras/61ddf77ed26d21407e28d21441fa3c22.poster.avif?t=1739799782\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626840/extras/61ddf77ed26d21407e28d21441fa3c22.webm?t=1739799782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626840/extras/61ddf77ed26d21407e28d21441fa3c22.mp4?t=1739799782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You will be rewarded!</strong></h2>Every gang has its treasures. Defeat them, and you can claim everything for yourself. After all, who said helping the city should come without rewards?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626840/extras/80ba710a40da533806ea15804f9f7754.poster.avif?t=1739799782\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626840/extras/80ba710a40da533806ea15804f9f7754.webm?t=1739799782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626840/extras/80ba710a40da533806ea15804f9f7754.mp4?t=1739799782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
